# Fedora COPR Repositories & Flathub Configuration
#
# Primary Hyprland stack COPR. nett00n/hyprland is automated for
# Fedora 43/44/45 (x86_64 + aarch64) and replaces the abandoned
# upstream Hyprland COPR.
# Covers: hyprland, hyprpaper, hyprlock, hypridle, hyprpicker,
#         hyprsunset, hyprland-guiutils, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland,
#         quickshell, uwsm
nett00n/hyprland

# Omarchy first-party binaries, source-built for Fedora.
# Covers: aether, cliamp, elsewhen, herdr, hyprland-preview-share-picker,
#         omacalc, omacut, omawrite, tensaku, try, ttfx
whelanh/omarchy

# Ghostty Terminal — REQUIRED: ghostty is in the base manifest and is NOT
# packaged in official Fedora. Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
scottames/ghostty

# Flathub Repository URL for Desktop Flatpak Apps
FLATHUB_URL=https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo
